In 2017, I was selected by IBM from over 2000 applicants, to participate in a pro bono public health project. A team of five of us were sent to the country of Panama for a month to work with the public health department there.
Since that time, the Zika pandemic has run its course. Human action didn’t end the Zika pandemic.
In some of the earliest and deadliest pandemics just about everybody who got sick died. WIth Zika, “Once a large proportion of the population is infected, they’re immune and they actually protect other people from getting infected .” That’s what happened with Zika.
Correlation is not causation, but after our visit to Panama, the Zika pandemic continued to wane. There are occasional outbreaks, but it hasn’t since reached the same level of concern.
zika-researchers-are-learning-more-about-the-long-term-consequences-for-children
With the mosquito borne illnesses (Zika, Chikungunya, Dengue fever), one objective of the Panama public health ministry was to minimize exposure to the virus by reducing exposure to the vector. In the US, in addition to the rapidly developed vaccine, the primary public health measures for addressing COVID include reducing exposure and limiting spread to others.
Higher risk individuals include older adults 65 years and older and those with serious underlying medical conditions; things like heart conditions, diabetes, obesity, immunocompromised, etc. To those we would add pregnant women for Zika because it can be transferred intrautero.
So, instead of a broad brush approach to fighting a disease, they concentrated their efforts on problem areas and potential problem areas. In doing so, they were better able to focus resources and were able to more quickly snuff out the hot spots.
Transmitted by respiratory droplets 74
Congenital Zika syndrome requires specialized care, physical therapy, pharmaco‐therapeutics for seizure disorders, correction/prosthetics for auditory and optical deficits 23
Compared to other recent epidemics, COVID-19 rates as one of the more pervasive in terms of countries affected and number of cases identified. Fortunately, the Case Fatality Rate (CFR) is lower than other major epidemics.
Areas of high population density– geographic as well as situational – cities, public transportation and air travel.
Individuals with symptoms have a higher risk of transmitting the disease to others. Testing should be focused on this population and action taken quickly to isolate and treat.
