When you click the Narrow button, the “Cognos Object Selector” window will appear. Select the object paths under the Cognos Content section and move them to the “Selected Items” section, then clickApply.
Any pending changes will be shown in blue.
ClickOK, and now you can go back into Cognos Connection and confim that the changes were made by looking at the properties of various reports.
