A butterfly valve is a quarter-turn valve with a plastic or metal disc in the middle that rotates on a metal stem or “stem”. If the stem is the body of a butterfly, then the discs are the “wings”.
Butterfly valves are perfect for this task because they stop fluid completely when closed. They are also very easy to clean because of their thin body.
