Traditional tubes will produce a lot of heat energy, while LED tubes will convert all electric energy into light energy, which will not cause energy waste. And there will be no fading of paper or clothing.
LED tubes will not produce noise, and it is the best choice for the use of precision electronic instruments. Suitable for library, office and other occasions.
Traditional fluorescent tubes use alternating current, so they produce 100-120 flashes per second. LED tube works with constant current of LED, which can directly convert alternating current to direct current, effectively reduce LED light decay, start fast, no flicker, and protect eyes.
