At the end December, Jon Olson will conclude his 23-year career as a champion of peer tutoring in writing at Penn State. As associate professor of writing in the Department of English and scholar in residence for writing and communication in Penn State Learning, Olson has mentored generations of peer tutors in writing and shaped the theory and practice that guides Penn State’s writing centers.
