The water – filled cooling method is to fill water in hollow steel members.Through the circulation of water in the steel structure, the heat absorbed by the steel itself is absorbed.Thus, the steel structure can keep low temperature in the fire and will not lose its bearing capacity due to too high temperature rise.In order to prevent rust and freeze, water to add rust inhibitor and antifreeze.The steel columns of the 64-story U.S. Steel Company building in Pittsburgh are water-cooled.
In terms of fire resistance, cladding method is superior to spraying method.The fire resistance of concrete, firebrick and other envelopment materials is better than general fireproof coating.Additional, the fireproof performance of new fire prevention board also is superior to fire prevention coating.Its fire resistance limit is obviously higher than the same thickness of the steel structure fire insulation material, more than the expansion of fire coatings.
Because the durability of cladding material, such as concrete, is better, it is not easy to deteriorate over time.But the durability is always the steel structure fire retardant coating failed to solve the good problem.Whether used for outdoor or indoor, the organic component of the thin and ultra-thin fireproof coating may produce decomposition, degradation, aging and other problems, so that the coating peeling powder or loss of fire performance. 3.3 construction
3.5 economy Spraying method is simple, short construction period and low construction cost.But the price of fireproof coating is high, and because coating has the shortcoming such as ageing, its maintenance cost is higher.The construction cost of wrapping method is high, but the material price is cheap, and the maintenance cost is low.Generally speaking, the encapsulation method has good economic efficiency.
The volume of fire retardant coating used by spraying method is small, and envelopment method USES envelopment material such as concrete, fireproof brick, will take up space, reduce the use of space.And enveloping material quality is also larger.
3) All kinds of fire prevention measures have their own advantages and disadvantages. In engineering application, they can learn from each other and make up for each other’s shortcomings.And can take different measures to set up multiple lines of fire defense.
